      467            TITLE "Заявки под покупателя"
      468            DEFAULT-BUTTON B-save CANCEL-BUTTON B-Cancel.
      469   ASSIGN
      470          FRAME Dialog-Frame:SCROLLABLE       = FALSE
      471          FRAME Dialog-Frame:HIDDEN           = TRUE.
      472   ASSIGN
      473          FILL-IN-1:READ-ONLY IN FRAME Dialog-Frame        = TRUE.
      474   ON GO OF FRAME Dialog-Frame
